- **Verification:** The line has slope \(\frac{1}{1-n}=-\frac{1}{n-1}\), which is not \(0,\infty,-1\) for \(n\ge3\); thus it is sunny. It passes through \((n,1)\) and no other integer point of \(T_n\), so all other points are covered by the vertical lines. Construction is valid.

